e="6" id="f-972">4</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="c-181" decimals="-6" name="us-gaap:BusinessCombinationAcquisitionRelatedCosts" scale="6" id="f-973">9</ix:nonFraction>, respectively.</span></div><div style="padding-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">(8)</span><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:8.24pt">Intersegment expense primarily consists of costs related to the sale of IT hardware, software solutions and services by the IT Solutions segment, to the Print and Other segment.</span></div><div style="padding-left:18pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">(9)</span><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:8.24pt">Print and Other includes financing income, which is included in Services, maintenance rentals and other. This is fully allocated to the Print and Other segment in support of its financing business. <ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="c-165" decimals="INF" name="xrx:InterestIncome" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" id="f-974"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="c-182" decimals="INF" name="xrx:InterestIncome" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" id="f-975"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="c-131" decimals="INF" name="xrx:InterestIncome" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" id="f-976"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="c-148" decimals="INF" name="xrx:InterestIncome" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" id="f-977">No</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction> financing income is allocated to the IT Solutions segment, as the segment has no finance assets.</span></div><div style="pa